#: ../../task_manager.rst:2
msgid "Task Manager"
msgstr "Opgaveadministrator"

#: ../../task_manager.rst:4
msgid "Access the **Task Manager** from the side menu."
msgstr "Få adgang til **Opgavehåndteringen** fra sidemenuen."

#: ../../task_manager.rst:8
msgid ""
"If some tasks are pending, the list will be shown in the Task Manager. "
"Tap on the **Refresh** (1) button to update the task list and the "
"**Delete** (2) to delete all tasks."
msgstr "Hvis nogle opgaver er ventende, vil listen blive vist i Opgavehåndteringen. Tryk på **Opdater** (1) knappen for at opdatere opgavelisten og **Slet** (2) for at slette alle opgaver."

#: ../../task_manager.rst:12
msgid "Any individual task can be deleted by pressing the delete button."
msgstr "Enhver individuel opgave kan slettes ved at trykke på sletteknappen."

#: ../../task_manager.rst:16
msgid ""
"A task that is displayed as a green running image means that it is "
"currently being executed."
msgstr "En opgave, der vises som et grønt kørende billede, betyder, at den er i gang med at blive udført."

#: ../../task_manager.rst:20
msgid "Once all tasks are completed, the **No Tasks Found** page is displayed."
msgstr "Når alle opgaver er udført, vises siden **Ingen opgaver fundet**."

